CM DK7ZB 10-element 28 Ohm Yagi for 70cm, 2.0 m boom
CM 8 mm parasitic elements, 10 mm radiator (DK7ZB's standard for this series).
CM Elements on polyamide clamps 2-3 mm clear above the boom: no boom correction.
CM 15 segments per element, extended thin-wire kernel, free space
CM Feedpoint is 28 Ohm - set xnec2c's SWR reference to 28 Ohm, not 50.
CM To 50 Ohm via the DK7ZB match: 2 parallel 75 Ohm quarter-wave coax lines.
